                        <span className="text-[10px] font-black opacity-40 uppercase tracking-widest">Fiscal Cycle Q3</span>
                     </div>
                     <h3 className="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4">Fiscal Audit Terminal</h3>
                     <p className="text-gray-400 font-bold max-w-lg mb-12 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Nodes currently showing average 22% growth. Cross-referencing logistics throughput with behavior patterns.
                     </p>
                     <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                        <button 
                          onClick={() => handleExportData('PDF')}
