        STRICT: 1-3 words max. No grammar. Only BFC. Fast!`,
        temperature: 0.1,
        maxOutputTokens: 20, // Limit generation length for speed
        thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 0 }
      },
    });

    return response.text?.trim() || "বলুন!";
  } catch (error: any) {
